{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'It... broke me all over again for a little bit, coming out of it. What if it gets worse?'","created_at":"2021-08-20T18:46:00.099000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878349165942419486","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Forgetting isn't an option. I refuse to forget her again, and even if I did, we all know I'd just... try and find out again.'","created_at":"2021-08-20T18:46:41.698000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878349340421259314","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"It only has power over you as long as you give it power.... this is your body.... your mind.... its not easy... but you have to accept the things you did... while not becoming consumed with regrets.  Live for today..... right now you are living in the past.... If I spent every day thinking about... her... I would never get anything done.  Take a step... keep moving.... accept who you were is not who you are.... and strive for tomorrow.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T18:49:34.979000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878350067214471258","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"(if I do end up doing this it'll definitely be after I get back on my meds, just for the record so I don't get yelled at for masochism :V)\n'...I'll try. Though... I'm wondering if... finding my parents would help. For closure - both mine and theirs. I was talking with someone else earlier who had run away from their parents for a century...'","created_at":"2021-08-20T18:52:31.872000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878350809157472276","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
