{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Roy moves over to stand by a tree nearby to let Sab and Mender have a moment to talk.","created_at":"2021-08-20T19:01:37.102000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878353096017866803","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Sabrine... this park is now your to tend to.  It will forever flourish.... as my essance has been infused into it.  I would like to live here until my time has come with your permission.... but after I go.... this is where you will be the one people come to for help and advice.... where you will turn people to the Path of Sandigil.  It's a lot to ask.... but I have faith in you, my first priestess.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T19:04:04.347000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878353713608130560","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
