{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'In what sense? I know it's not good to stake one's whole identity on another person, and I... don't know how long my lifespan is. It's likely one of us will outlive the other, and we don't know who.'","created_at":"2021-08-20T19:13:08.323000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878355995208843364","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'So it's important that we be able to function separately, as well as together, if that makes sense?'","created_at":"2021-08-20T19:13:39.869000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878356127522381885","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I said I knew a man of rock.... who has endless life span... marry a goblin.... with a span of a few decades..... never saw truer love\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T19:14:38.683000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878356374206156821","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Roy walks back to the group, having heard most of the talk anyway, but now invited to it.\n\"I'm a swarmkeeper. There has never really been any 'alone' for ones like me. And even in my biggest challenge so far, which I would've expected to have to handle as alone as can be, I still had people backing me up, with someone carrying my kneecap first and foremost.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T19:15:32.361000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878356599348015134","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"she blushes. 'I-I was hoping it would help...'","created_at":"2021-08-20T19:16:00.387000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878356716897587220","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'That being said. I would absolutely help him in any challenge he has to face... but I know there's some where I might be a burden. Where the best I can do is just stand on the sidelines and offer support, even if I want to help more.'","created_at":"2021-08-20T19:17:39.277000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878357131672293448","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
